## 1. Overview of the Workspace

The workspace consists of two separate applications:
1. **Simple Quote Generator (Root Level)**: A lightweight, frontend-only quote presentation site using Vanilla JS, HTML, and CSS.
2. **CaptionCraft AI (`captioncraft-ai/` directory)**: A production-ready, full-stack AI-powered social media caption, quote, and post idea generation SaaS platform built using React/Vite/Tailwind and Node.js/Express/MongoDB.

```mermaid
graph TD
    Workspace[Workspace Root]
    Workspace --> SimpleApp[Vanilla Quote App]
    Workspace --> CaptionCraft[CaptionCraft AI Folder]
    
    CaptionCraft --> Client[React Frontend client/]
    CaptionCraft --> Server[Express Backend server/]
    
    Server --> DB[(MongoDB Atlas)]
    Server --> Gemini[Gemini 2.0 Flash API]
```

---

## 2. Project 1: Simple Quote Generator (Root Level)

This is a clean, simple starter application designed to display random motivational quotes and allow users to tweet them.

### File Inventory
*   **[index.html](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/index.html)**: The structural HTML document. Defines a central card container for the quotes, two control buttons (New Quote, Tweet), and imports the Inter font along with `style.css` and `script.js`.
*   **[style.css](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/style.css)**: Implements custom modern styles. Uses dark mode color schemes, modern card layouts, linear gradients, and hover transitions.
*   **[script.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/script.js)**: Holds the local quote database array and logic to randomly select a quote or open a Twitter tweet draft with the current quote content.

---

## 3. Project 2: CaptionCraft AI (SaaS Platform)

A full-stack, responsive AI generation platform designed for influencers and content creators. It utilizes Google's **Gemini 2.0 Flash AI** to automatically generate aesthetic captions, quotes, and visual concept directions.

---

### Frontend Architecture (Client)
Located at `captioncraft-ai/client/`. Built on **React 19** + **Vite** + **Tailwind CSS**.

#### Technical Stack & Key Dependencies:
*   `react` & `react-dom` (v19) - Component model.
*   `react-router-dom` - Page routing and navigation.
*   `framer-motion` - Dynamic animations and transitions.
*   `lucide-react` - Minimalist vector icons.
*   `axios` - API communications with the Express server.
*   `tailwindcss` - CSS utility framework.

#### Page Routing & Views (`client/src/pages/`):
*   **[Home.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/pages/Home.jsx)**: Main feed featuring:
    *   An infinite scroll Masonry grid of quote/caption cards.
    *   Search filter capability by text.
    *   Filters by categories (Love, Motivation, Sad, Attitude) and social platforms (Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest).
    *   Hindi + English language toggle.
    *   Action buttons (Heart to save, copy to clipboard, share).
*   **[Chat.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/pages/Chat.jsx)**: A conversational chat interface to converse with CaptionCraft AI in real-time, receiving mood/context-based recommendations.
*   **[Ideas.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/pages/Ideas.jsx)**: Specialized module for generating visual instructions, post designs, and viral hashtags for selected social niches.
*   **[Instagram.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/pages/Instagram.jsx)**: Focused interface for generating platform-specific caption styles.
*   **[Saved.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/pages/Saved.jsx)**: Personal bookmark archive of quotes liked by the user.

#### Common Components & Configuration:
*   **[Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/components/common/Navbar.jsx)**: Top navigation bar containing links, interactive states, logo, and active page styling.
*   **[main.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/main.jsx)** & **[App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/src/App.jsx)**: Entry points, importing styles and routing elements.
*   **[tailwind.config.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/tailwind.config.js)** & **[postcss.config.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/client/postcss.config.js)**: Config files for styling pipelines.

---

### Backend Architecture (Server)
Located at `captioncraft-ai/server/`. Built with **Node.js** + **Express.js** + **MongoDB (Mongoose)**.

#### Core Configuration:
*   **[server.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/server.js)**: System startup. Sets up express, rate limits, routes, CORS rules, compression, logging (Morgan), and global error handlers.
*   **[config/db.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/config/db.js)**: Handles the connection to MongoDB Atlas.

#### Mongoose Schemas & Models (`server/models/`):
*   **[User.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/models/User.js)**: User registration profiles, password hashing using `bcryptjs`, and JWT tokens.
*   **[Quote.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/models/Quote.js)**: Captions, authors, languages (English/Hindi), platforms, categories, likes, copies, and custom flags for AI-generated posts.
*   **[SavedContent.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/models/SavedContent.js)**: Tracks relationships between user accounts and their favorited items.
*   **[Category.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/models/Category.js)**: Defines quote categories (Love, Motivation, etc.).
*   **[AIHistory.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/models/AIHistory.js)**: Logs requests made to the Gemini model for analytics and audit trails.

#### Routes & Controllers (`server/routes/` & `server/controllers/`):
*   **Authentication (auth)**:
    *   `authRoutes.js` ➡️ `authController.js`
    *   Endpoints: User registration (`/register`) and login (`/login`).
*   **Content Feed (content)**:
    *   `contentRoutes.js` ➡️ `contentController.js`
    *   Endpoints: Get feed items (`/`), add static items (`/`), get by ID, search, and update analytics counts (likes/copies).
*   **AI Generation (generate)**:
    *   `generateRoutes.js` ➡️ `generateController.js`
    *   Endpoints: Generate captions (`/captions`), generate quotes (`/quotes`), post ideas (`/post-ideas`), and conversational chatbot interactions (`/chat`).
*   **Bookmarks (save)**:
    *   `saveRoutes.js` ➡️ `saveController.js`
    *   Endpoints: Toggle bookmark saves (`/toggle`) and retrieve saved files (`/`).
*   **User Profiles (user)**:
    *   `userRoutes.js` ➡️ `userController.js`
    *   Endpoints: Fetch current user metadata (`/me`).
*   **Categories**:
    *   `categoryRoutes.js`
    *   Endpoints: List existing system categories (`/`).

#### Services (`server/services/`):
*   **[aiService.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/services/aiService.js)**: Manages interactions with Google's Gemini SDK. Contains custom prompting parameters designed to output clean, parsable JSON arrays containing generated captions, emojis, and hashtags. Includes custom fallback lists if keys or quotas are absent.
*   **[cacheService.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/services/cacheService.js)**: In-memory cache using `node-cache` to speed up database reads.

#### Middlewares & Utilities (`server/middleware/` & `server/utils/`):
*   **[middleware/auth.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/middleware/auth.js)**: JWT authentication validator, injecting user contexts into requests.
*   **[middleware/rateLimiter.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/middleware/rateLimiter.js)**: Restricts API calls to protect Gemini usage and prevent DDoS.
*   **[middleware/errorHandler.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/middleware/errorHandler.js)**: Centralized error handling returning structured JSON errors.
*   **[utils/apiResponse.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/utils/apiResponse.js)**: Normalizes API responses.

#### Seeding Script (`server/seeds/`):
*   **[seeds/index.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/seeds/index.js)**: Standardized database seed file to wipe and pre-populate your Mongo instance with static motivational content.

