## 4. Smart Engineering & Design Highlights

1.  **DNS Robustness / Windows Fallback**:
    In Windows development environments, Node.js can fail to resolve DNS SRV records (`mongodb+srv`). To prevent database connection failures, a custom fallback directly overrides default lookup servers to Google DNS (`8.8.8.8`) inside [server.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/server.js#L3).
2.  **Graceful API Degradation**:
    If your Google Gemini API key is missing or encounters a rate-limit error, [aiService.js](file:///c:/Users/Hasnain/Desktop/Motivational-quotes/captioncraft-ai/server/services/aiService.js#L157-L193) automatically drops back to pre-written high-quality prompts and responses so the user experience is never interrupted.
3.  **Strict Security Configurations**:
    The backend uses `helmet` to secure HTTP headers, dynamic `cors` to authorize dev ports, and `express-rate-limit` to prevent API endpoint abuse.

